flowchart TD
    classDef dewan fill:#e6f7ff,stroke:#1890ff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef payment fill:#fff0f6,stroke:#eb2f96,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef core fill:#f0f5ff,stroke:#2f54eb,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef storage fill:#fffbe6,stroke:#faad14,stroke-width:2px;

    StartReg([Calon Pengguna Registrasi]):::dewan --> InputForm[Input: Nama, Email, No HP, Asal Dapil, Pilihan Subdomain]:::dewan
    InputForm --> ValidateSlug{Validasi Subdomain:<br/>Apakah slug tersedia & bukan kata terlarang?}:::core
    
    ValidateSlug -->|Ditolak/Duplikat| ReturnSlugErr[Tolak: Minta Ganti Slug Subdomain]:::dewan
    ValidateSlug -->|Valid| SelectPlan[Pilih Tier Langganan:<br/>Bulanan / Tahunan / Periode 5 Tahun]:::dewan
    
    SelectPlan --> CreateInvoice[Subscription Engine:<br/>Generate Invoice & Token Transaksi]:::core
    CreateInvoice --> MidtransSnap[Payment Gateway: Buka Snap Window Midtrans/Xendit]:::payment
    
    MidtransSnap --> UserPay[Dewan Bayar: QRIS / VA / Kartu Kredit]:::dewan
    UserPay --> GatewayWebhook[Payment Gateway Kirim Webhook ke Backend]:::payment
    
    subgraph IdempotentVerification [Verifikasi Transaksional Aman]
        GatewayWebhook --> VerifySig{Cek Signature Key & Idempotency Key}:::core
        VerifySig -->|Invalid| DropWebhook[Drop Request: Potensi Serangan Fraud]:::core
        VerifySig -->|Valid| CheckStatus{Status Pembayaran?}:::payment
    end

    CheckStatus -->|Failed/Expired| MarkCancel[Update Status: INVOICE_EXPIRED]:::core
    CheckStatus -->|Settlement / Sukses| AtomicProvision[Eksekusi Atomic Provisioning Transaction]:::core

    subgraph TenantProvisioning [Penyediaan Workspace & Subdomain]
        AtomicProvision --> CreateTenant[1. Insert Tenant Record & Role Dewan]:::storage
        AtomicProvision --> CreateSubdomain[2. Daftarkan DNS Subdomain: dewan.polaris.id]:::storage
        AtomicProvision --> InitQuota[3. Alokasikan Kuota Token AI Bulanan]:::storage
        AtomicProvision --> InitTheme[4. Inisialisasi Template Default Website Pribadi]:::storage
    end

    TenantProvisioning --> SendWelcome[Kirim Email Onboarding & Akses Login]:::core
    SendWelcome --> ReadyToLogin([Dewan Siap Akses Dashboard]):::dewan